---
// Sample Visibility Check & Suburb Rank Tracking Mockup (Dark Purple Theme)
---

<div class="proof-container">
  <!-- Left Card: Sample Audit Diagnosis -->
  <div class="proof-card card-surface audit-sample-card">
    <div class="card-header">
      <div class="header-tag">Sample Visibility Check Report</div>
      <div class="report-meta">Anonymised Auckland Tradie (Pre-Optimisation)</div>
    </div>

    <div class="audit-score-row">
      <div class="score-circle">
        <span class="score-val">42%</span>
        <span class="score-label">Visibility</span>
      </div>
      <div class="score-summary">
        <h3 class="summary-title">3 critical ranking issues identified</h3>
        <p class="summary-text">
          Fixing these three items is the fastest path to climbing from #7 into the top 3 pack.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <ul class="audit-checks-list">
      <li class="check-item issue">
        <div class="check-status-icon error" aria-label="Action required">✕</div>
        <div class="check-info">
          <span class="check-name">Primary GBP Category</span>
          <span class="check-detail">Set as "Handyman" instead of "Plumber". Major ranking penalty.</span>
        </div>
      </li>
      <li class="check-item issue">
        <div class="check-status-icon error" aria-label="Action required">✕</div>
        <div class="check-info">
          <span class="check-name">Review Velocity & Replies</span>
          <span class="check-detail">Last review was 4 months ago; 0 replies containing service keywords.</span>
        </div>
      </li>
      <li class="check-item issue">
        <div class="check-status-icon error" aria-label="Action required">✕</div>
        <div class="check-info">
          <span class="check-name">Website Schema & Mobile Speed</span>
          <span class="check-detail">Missing LocalBusiness schema; mobile site takes 4.8s to load.</span>
        </div>
      </li>
      <li class="check-item ok">
        <div class="check-status-icon pass" aria-label="Passing">✓</div>
        <div class="check-info">
          <span class="check-name">NAP Consistency</span>
          <span class="check-detail">Business name, address, and phone number match across existing directories.</span>
        </div>
      </li>
    </ul>

    <div class="card-footer-note">
      <span>Every free check includes this full diagnosis for your specific service and town.</span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Right Card: Suburb Rank Tracking Matrix -->
  <div class="proof-card card-surface rank-matrix-card">
    <div class="card-header">
      <div class="header-tag">Monthly Geo-Grid Tracking</div>
      <div class="report-meta">Live ranking across your service area</div>
    </div>

    <div class="matrix-explanation">
      <h3 class="matrix-title">How you dominate your local territory</h3>
      <p class="matrix-text">
        Google Maps rankings change suburb by suburb. We track your position on a 5km radius grid so you know exactly where you are winning calls.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="geo-grid-mockup">
      <div class="grid-header-row">
        <span>Target Suburb</span>
        <span>Search Query</span>
        <span>Position</span>
      </div>
      <div class="grid-row rank-1">
        <span class="suburb-name">Ponsonby</span>
        <span class="query-name">hot water cylinder repair</span>
        <span class="rank-chip rank-top">#1 in Map</span>
      </div>
      <div class="grid-row rank-1">
        <span class="suburb-name">Grey Lynn</span>
        <span class="query-name">emergency plumber</span>
        <span class="rank-chip rank-top">#1 in Map</span>
      </div>
      <div class="grid-row rank-2">
        <span class="suburb-name">Mount Eden</span>
        <span class="query-name">blocked drain unblocking</span>
        <span class="rank-chip rank-top">#2 in Map</span>
      </div>
      <div class="grid-row rank-2">
        <span class="suburb-name">Newmarket</span>
        <span class="query-name">plumber near me</span>
        <span class="rank-chip rank-top">#2 in Map</span>
      </div>
      <div class="grid-row rank-3">
        <span class="suburb-name">Takapuna</span>
        <span class="query-name">gas fitter auckland</span>
        <span class="rank-chip rank-top">#3 in Map</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="proof-placeholder-band">
      <span class="placeholder-label">[CLIENT RESULT PLACEHOLDER]</span>
      <span class="placeholder-desc">Real case studies & local ranking charts added upon client consent.</span>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<style>
  .proof-container {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 2rem;
    width: 100%;
  }

  .proof-card {
    padding: 2rem;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
  }

  .card-header {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.25rem;
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border-subtle);
    padding-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .header-tag {
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    color: var(--color-primary-light);
  }

  .report-meta {
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  .audit-score-row {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 1.25rem;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    background: rgba(157, 56, 224, 0.12);
    border: 1px solid rgba(168, 85, 247, 0.2);
    padding: 1rem;
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
  }

  .score-circle {
    width: 64px;
    height: 64px;
    border-radius: var(--radius-full);
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #9D38E0 0%, #6D10A3 100%);
    color: var(--color-white);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    box-shadow: 0 0 16px rgba(157, 56, 224, 0.4);
  }

  .score-val {
    font-size: 1.125rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    line-height: 1;
  }

  .score-label {
    font-size: 0.625rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    color: #E9D5FF;
  }

  .summary-title {
    font-size: 1.0625rem;
    color: #FFFFFF;
    margin-bottom: 0.25rem;
  }

  .summary-text {
    font-size: 0.8125rem;
    line-height: 1.4;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
  }

  .audit-checks-list {
    list-style: none;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.75rem;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }

  .check-item {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 0.75rem;
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    padding: 0.6rem 0.75rem;
    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
  }

  .check-item.issue {
    background-color: rgba(239, 68, 68, 0.12);
    border: 1px solid rgba(239, 68, 68, 0.25);
  }

  .check-item.ok {
    background-color: rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.12);
    border: 1px solid rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.25);
  }

  .check-status-icon {
    width: 22px;
    height: 22px;
    border-radius: var(--radius-full);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    margin-top: 2px;
  }

  .check-status-icon.error {
    background-color: #EF4444;
    color: white;
  }

  .check-status-icon.pass {
    background-color: #10B981;
    color: white;
  }

  .check-info {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.15rem;
  }

  .check-name {
    font-weight: 700;
    color: #FFFFFF;
  }

  .check-detail {
    font-size: 0.8125rem;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
  }

  .card-footer-note {
    margin-top: auto;
    font-size: 0.8125rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--color-primary-light);
    text-align: center;
    padding-top: 0.85rem;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border-subtle);
  }

  .matrix-explanation {
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
  }

  .matrix-title {
    font-size: 1.125rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.35rem;
  }

  .matrix-text {
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    line-height: 1.45;
  }

  .geo-grid-mockup {
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
    overflow: hidden;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    background: rgba(18, 2, 31, 0.7);
  }

  .grid-header-row {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1.2fr 2fr 1fr;
    padding: 0.6rem 0.85rem;
    background-color: rgba(157, 56, 224, 0.15);
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: #FFFFFF;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border);
  }

  .grid-row {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1.2fr 2fr 1fr;
    align-items: center;
    padding: 0.65rem 0.85rem;
    font-size: 0.8125rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border-subtle);
  }

  .grid-row:last-child {
    border-bottom: none;
  }

  .suburb-name {
    font-weight: 700;
    color: #FFFFFF;
  }

  .query-name {
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    white-space: nowrap;
    overflow: hidden;
    text-overflow: ellipsis;
  }

  .rank-chip {
    display: inline-flex;
    justify-content: center;
    padding: 0.2rem 0.5rem;
    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 800;
  }

  .rank-top {
    background-color: rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.2);
    color: #34D399;
    border: 1px solid rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.4);
  }

  .proof-placeholder-band {
    margin-top: auto;
    background-color: rgba(157, 56, 224, 0.08);
    border: 1px dashed var(--color-border);
    padding: 0.75rem;
    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
    text-align: center;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.2rem;
  }

  .placeholder-label {
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    color: var(--color-primary-light);
  }

  .placeholder-desc {
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    color: var(--color-text-light);
  }

  @media (max-width: 860px) {
    .proof-container {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
</style>
